.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RELEASE ANNOUNCEMENT PUBLISH"
.SH NAME
hamstik release announcement publish \- Publish the draft as an immutable announcement revision
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik release announcement publish [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Publish the draft as an immutable announcement revision
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I RELEASE_ID
Release version id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --revision
Draft revision to publish (defaults to the current draft's)
.TP
.B --confirm-empty
Confirm publishing an announcement with no included Work Items
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --reason
Why the announcement was published
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
